  "overview": {
    "id": "overview",
    "x": 108,
    "y": 80,
    "width": 1400,
    "height": 150,
    "layer": -3,
    "movable": false,
    "movableInEdit": false,
    "css": {
      "font-size": "25px"
    },
    "html": "MOVE is the one function that needs two holders at once, so it spells them out: <b>fromHolder</b> is where the widgets come from, <b>toHolder</b> is where they go. Its third input is the usual <b>target</b>, for moving widgets that are in no holder at all. All three accept a list of widget ids or the name of a collection, and fromHolder wins over target the same way holder does everywhere else."
  },
